  "policy_rationale": [
    "Multiple independently hosted be./by. or /be/ multilingual routes contain severe malformed translation-like prose in both source collections. Such routes outside the local .by domain family or explicit publisher exceptions are held for review; not every quarantined page is declared bad.",
    "Known bad source families apply before exceptions. The narrow .ru/naviny/ clone route is supported by two separately sampled hosts and the earlier lorealcolortrophy.ru evidence; ordinary .ru or .com articles are not blanket-rejected.",
    "Publisher exceptions are based on observed coherent Belarusian editorial/Wikimedia content, not topic or viewpoint. They still pass every prior language/leakage/dedup gate and the new text-template checks.",
    "Whole-row template gates target repeated read-more archive entries, dated/tagged teaser indexes, dominant related-link tails and large raw infobox templates. Minor footers, isolated citations, short repetitions and OCR artifacts are not claimed eliminated.",
    "Repeated independent content reviews of local CC100 found malformed game/dictionary/chat-service boilerplate, navigation-dominated pages and extraction corruption. The source is quarantined as a whole because local per-document URLs are unavailable; this is not a claim that every CC100 document is bad.",
    "Repeated independently selected legacy wikiquote records were empty-quote stubs dominated by raw infoboxes. The tiny source is held out as a whole pending an extraction-quality rebuild.",
    "Two source-bound normalized content hashes identify specific reviewed curated defects; this is targeted reviewed evidence, not a blanket exclusion of classical Belarusian or subject matter.",
    "Conservative Google Play controls and extreme Cyrillic-fragment tests complement template controls. Rejected-example review is labelled heuristic_not_native and explicitly distinguishes syllable spacing from Latin/Cyrillic homoglyph corruption."
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "Agent review is not independent native-speaker approval.",
    "Conservative multilingual-route admission can quarantine useful human-authored translations; no attempt was made to rewrite or repair text.",
    "A .by host is not a quality guarantee; known bad hosts override the routing exception.",
    "Final confirmation uses an explicitly described staged44 review set and cannot establish a population error rate.",
    "Substantial but coherent article/teaser/recommendation/fragment residue and isolated language/OCR errors remain; no clean-native-prose guarantee is made."
  ],
